  "bodyHash": "BOZheaZSGIk=",
  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Soft Imprints</strong> 是一款高度可配置的用戶端模組，可在實體移動時於方塊上增添動態足跡</span></h2><h3><span style=\"font-size:22px\"><strong>功能特色：</strong></span></h3><ul>\n<li>完全用戶端運作</li>\n<li>當實體在支援的方塊上行走時，會留下可見足跡</li>\n<li>內建雪、雪層、沙與紅沙的配置檔案</li>\n<li>遊戲內配置畫面，附即時預覽功能</li>\n<li>可選的模型為基礎足跡擷取，以獲得更精確形狀</li>\n</ul><h3><span style=\"font-size:22px\"><strong>設定選項：</strong></span></h3><ul>\n<li>足跡檢測的更新頻率</li>\n<li>足跡的外觀與渲染樣式</li>\n<li>快取與效能限制</li>\n<li>基於邊界框或模型的足跡偵測方式</li>\n<li>哪些實體可以留下足跡</li>\n<li>哪些方塊可以接受足跡</li>\n<li>個別配置檔案與整合開關</li>\n</ul><h3><span style=\"font-size:22px\"><strong>附加資源包：</strong></span></h3><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fundergarden-imprints\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/da7e66562126aff01946b27f6a3746a66254806f.png\" alt=\"深淵國度足跡\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffaithful-imprints-32x\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fab6497f3289ab41159ab68be60de7adf5dc15f6.png\" alt=\"忠實足跡 32x\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffaithful-imprints-64x\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7c8e2c3d6f202a1ddac14d2a6f2d02ab2dce2e1f.png\" alt=\"忠實足跡 64x\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">歡迎將此模組用於整合包中</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">模組的 Fabric 版本需要 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Fabric API</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">若您遇到任何錯誤，請在此處留言或至 <a href=\"https://github.com/0Templ/SoftImprints/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 回報&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p></p>",
